{"code":0,"message":"SUCCESS","data":{"tab_index":0,"tab_item":[{"tab_type":8,"client_tab_type":0,"title":"找剧","cell_data":[{"cell_id":6952850996422770718,"show_type":401,"cell_name":"","cell_operation_type":1,"use_recommend":true,"cell_abstract":"","cell_id_str":"6952850996422770718","cell_data":[{"cell_id":6952850996422770718,"show_type":402,"cell_name":"小卡","cell_operation_type":0,"use_recommend":false,"video_data":[{"vid":"7588005030070848537","cover":"https://p3-reading-sign.fqnovelpic.com/novel-pic/c23c15fca3acd07e468d0b9bef707d1b~tplv-81nmtwyey9-superreso-aifit:400:0.image?lk3s=ae45642e&x-expires=1799163119&x-signature=ECnD26w0Mf3pINiCiUwShoJl5DE%3D","duration":6718,"title":"她从疯人院归来","video_desc":"真千金秦暖遭假千金秦柔构陷，被偏心的家人送进精神病院受尽折磨，归来后化身“疯批美人”，以彼之道还施彼身，步步为营揭穿秦柔的恶毒面具，夺回属于自己的一切。竹马神经专家顾衍始终不离不弃，成为她最坚实的后盾。当家人幡然醒悟时，秦暖早已涅槃重生，在复仇与救赎中，她既手撕绿茶、打脸偏心家人，又收获纯粹爱恋，爽感与温情并存，全程高能无尿点，妥妥的女频复仇爽文天花板。","series_id":"7588002747505462297","episode":true,"vertical":true,"content_type":1,"recommend_info":"{\"channel_id\":\"94349560332\",\"request_id\":\"20261106233157F850A8360625E787FC5A\",\"rank\":\"1\",\"queue_names\":\"shortplay\",\"final_queue_name\":\"heji\",\"gid\":\"7588002747505462297\",\"plan_id\":\"1\",\"is_show_ad_flag\":\"0\",\"series_pred_score\":\"{\\\"finish\\\":0.0029810327105224133,\\\"collect\\\":0.030675802379846573,\\\"stream_ctr\\\":0.039780594408512115,\\\"staytime_stream\\\":1.0176129341125488,\\\"absolute_staytime\\\":0.11575839668512344,\\\"like\\\":0.052618950605392456,\\\"normalized_duration\\\":0.7460454702377319}\"}","recommend_group_id":"7588002747505462297","play_cnt":14707,"book_exist":false,"copyright":"tomatotv","sub_title":"逆袭·女性成长","score":"8.2","use_video_model":true,"episode_cnt":67,"video_platform":3,"disable_play":false,"category_schema":"[{\"category_id\":5031,\"name\":\"逆袭\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5031&categoryName=逆袭&genreType=130&gender=0&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5045,\"name\":\"女性成长\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://